        "content": "<p>I encountered the problem when working on <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover/cslib/pull/491\">cslib#491</a>.  This procedure should reproduce the problem:<br>\n(1) Check out the commit f556a19 from <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover/cslib/pull/491\">cslib#491</a>.<br>\n(2) Open the file <code>Cslib/Computability/Languages/MyhillNerode.lean</code>.<br>\n(3) Replace the <code>simpa</code> on line 82 by:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">clear</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">heq</span>\n<span class=\"n\">grind</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
